<title>JAPAN: Komatsu shares rise after named in TSE option list.</title>
<headline>Komatsu shares rise after named in TSE option list.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Komatsu Ltd rose on Tuesday morning, lifted by news that the company was included in the Tokyo Stock Exchange's list of 20 companies that are eligible to list stock options, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0032 GMT, Komatsu shares were up 20 yen at 915 yen. Turnover was 1.93 million, the fifth largest volume on the first section of the Tokyo bourse.</p>
